  "limitations": [
    "Coupang rows reserve request slots; pending rows may be requests whose final outcome was not recorded. They remain counted conservatively.",
    "Historical search response contents and per-request newly matched products are not retained. Dedup replay predicts request savings only, not new price matches or a 90% success rate.",
    "Safe replay suppresses only calls AFTER an earlier outcome=ok for the same provider/query/date. Errors before the first success remain available for bounded retry.",
    "Different same-day successful responses may contain different products or prices. Match preservation cannot be established from aggregate call logs alone.",
    "Historical targets reconstructed from CURRENT catalog/eligible cache/current vendor option have target/option drift. Actual observed target snapshots are reported separately.",
    "Attempted product sets exist in a mutable singleton resume state, not an immutable daily ledger; 2026-09-27 illustrates reset provenance.",
    "Coupang keyword logs truncate at 80 characters; zero collector calls hit that boundary in this evidence period."
